%% Sprint Stats-V2 — Customizer Flow (200 stats, search + filter + drag-drop + virtual scroll)
%% Spec : docs/specs/sprint-stats-v2.md (RF-04, RF-16)
%% ADRs : 058 (catalogo estatico), 062 (coach grouped), 063 (direction semantics)
%% Goal : Render <500ms 200 stats; UX escalavel; mobile-friendly

flowchart TD
    Start([Usuario clica Editar layout])
    Start --> Load{Layout existente ou novo}

    Load -->|existente| LoadExist[GET /api/hud-layouts/:id<br/>fields_json: array StatFieldRef]
    Load -->|novo a partir de template| LoadTpl[POST /api/hud-layouts<br/>body name + base_template<br/>options: mttDefault mttCashCompact tournamentEarly tournamentLate]

    LoadExist --> Init
    LoadTpl --> Init

    Init[Customizer monta:<br/>- catalog: 200+ HudStatCatalog static<br/>- layout.fields_json: subset selecionado<br/>- 16 group accordions]

    Init --> InitialRender{Stats no layout > 50}
    InitialRender -->|sim| CollapseAll[Accordion collapse-all default<br/>exceto basics]
    InitialRender -->|nao| ExpandAll[Accordion expand-all default]

    CollapseAll --> RenderGate
    ExpandAll --> RenderGate

    RenderGate[Render perf gate:<br/>useMemo grouped stats<br/>react-window virtual scroll por accordion<br/>quando grupo expandido > 50 stats]

    RenderGate --> ReadyUI{UI pronta para edicao}

    ReadyUI -->|user digita search| Search[Search bar<br/>debounce 200ms]
    ReadyUI -->|user toggla group filter| Filter[Filter pill chip<br/>16 group toggles]
    ReadyUI -->|user drag stat| Drag[dnd-kit core<br/>aria-grabbed]
    ReadyUI -->|user edita StatFieldRef| Edit[Inline edit:<br/>label override<br/>decimals<br/>custom_target_min/max<br/>reset to default]
    ReadyUI -->|user clica Add stat from catalog| AddDialog[Dialog Add Stat<br/>search + group filter sobre catalogo]
    ReadyUI -->|user clica Save| Save

    Search --> SearchResult{Match contra<br/>id OR label case-insensitive}
    SearchResult -->|mais de 0 matches| ExpandMatched[Auto-expand grupos<br/>com matches<br/>highlight matched stats]
    SearchResult -->|0 matches| EmptyState[Empty state<br/>Nenhum stat encontrado para X]
    ExpandMatched --> ReadyUI
    EmptyState --> ReadyUI

    Filter --> FilterApply[Mostra so grupos<br/>com chips ativos]
    FilterApply --> ReadyUI

    Drag --> DragType{Mesmo grupo ou cross-group}
    DragType -->|mesmo grupo| Reorder[Reorder position dentro<br/>do mesmo group]
    DragType -->|cross-group| MoveGroup[Update group denorm<br/>+ reorder na nova localizacao]
    Reorder --> Dirty[Mark layout dirty]
    MoveGroup --> Dirty

    Edit --> Dirty
    AddDialog --> AddConfirm[User seleciona stat<br/>+ confirma adicionar]
    AddConfirm --> Dirty

    Dirty --> AutoSaveOpt{Auto-save habilitado}
    AutoSaveOpt -->|sim debounce 2s| AutoSave[PUT /api/hud-layouts/:id<br/>body: fields_json + is_custom=true RF-14]
    AutoSaveOpt -->|nao| WaitSave[User clica Save explicito]

    Save[Save explicito]
    Save --> AutoSave
    WaitSave --> Save

    AutoSave --> ZodValid{Server Zod valid RF-10:<br/>id snake_case<br/>direction enum<br/>unit enum<br/>targetMin/Max number}
    ZodValid -->|400| ToastErr[Toast erro<br/>destaca campo invalido]
    ZodValid -->|200| ToastOk[Toast Layout salvo]

    ToastErr --> ReadyUI
    ToastOk --> ReadyUI

    ReadyUI -->|user fecha customizer| End([Fim])

    %% Mobile (<375px)
    %% RNF-01: drag-drop disabled em touch -> usar arrows up/down
    %% RNF-01: accordion collapse-all default
    %% RNF-01: search bar sticky top
    %% RNF-01: virtual scroll mandatorio em snapshot editor

    %% Performance gates (RF-16)
    %% AC-16.1: Bench customizer 200 stats < 500ms
    %% AC-4.2: Render 200 stats < 500ms (React Profiler)
    %% AC-4.4: Virtual scroll ativo quando layout > 50 stats (e2e snapshot DOM count)
